# Plain reads no `this`, so it has no parameter that holds what it makes. The objects are held at a node of their own: the layout stays in sight, and so does what stands above it. L0 = Base, L1 = Plain.
# RUN: link layouts mechanisms=all
# CHECK: layout L0 family=F0 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L1 family=F0 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
